seekwright check
================
config      check_unbuilt.toml  (present)
default     none (callers must pass provider)
permitted   (unset: every enabled provider)
providers
  enabled   exa:free, parallel:free, search1api
  effective exa:free, parallel:free, search1api
  built     exa:free, parallel:free
  untested  search1api is untested on this port: no live verification against the real endpoint has happened in the OCaml build, and a reachability probe is not one
  exa:free  no connectivity probe  unbilled
  parallel:free no connectivity probe  unbilled
  search1api not built on this port
  probes    no connectivity probe on this port for: exa:free, parallel:free -- built here, and their readiness is the MCP handshake at warmup
fetch
  enabled   40000 chars max, 3 redirects, private addresses blocked
  primary   http (the local reader)
  extractor stdlib
  cache     off
agent
  disabled in config
